OL,3,GNEWSAHow grief support helped siblings
OL,4,Aafter family loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brother and sister who lost three
OL,7,Fgrandparents in a matter of weeks have
OL,8,Fbecome "happy little people again"
OL,9,Fafter being supported by an Isle of Man
OL,10,Fbereavement charity, their mother has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FElla, 13, said the deaths left her
OL,14,Flacking confidence and feeling "very
OL,15,Fquiet". However, she said attending a
OL,16,FCruseKids group for grieving children
OL,17,Fhelped her.
OL,19,FShe and her brother Charlie, 11, from
OL,20,FDouglas, took part in the Children in
OL,21,FNeed-funded sessions together.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
